              "sectionSpacing": 8,
              "source": "\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:14.5px;color:#C9D2E0;line-height:1.55;padding:0 0 16px 0;\"\u003eThis line is MIP-integrated - the machine handshakes each piece and closes each tray on its own. Your job is mostly to watch this screen and complete the container when it is ready.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"46\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:17px;background-color:#22A8CC;color:#0B1220;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:34px;\"\u003e1\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-top:2px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eWatch the current tray\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;padding-top:3px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eCurrent Tray\u003c/span\u003e shows what the line has built toward the tray in progress. It closes on its own, by weight or by count depending on this line - there is nothing to press for it.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"46\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:17px;background-color:#22A8CC;color:#0B1220;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:34px;\"\u003e2\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-top:2px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eComplete the container\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;padding-top:3px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eOnce enough trays have gone in, press \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eComplete\u003c/span\u003e under \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eWorkOrder Completion Gate\u003c/span\u003e to finish and ship it. This also posts the shipment to AIM automatically; if that post fails you get a warning toast, and it retries on its own - no action needed from you.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e",
              "style": {
